<title>USA: Neogen to market microbiological tests.</title>
<headline>Neogen to market microbiological tests.</headline>
<dateline>LANSING, Mich. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neogen Corp said Tuesday it signed an agreement with  Orion Diagnostica of Finland to distribute Hygicult microbiological tests to the food industry.</p>
<p>Neogen will market four different tests for microbiological contamination.</p>
<p>It said the agreement gives Neogen products to fill voids in its current product line and establish another line of defense in food safety testing.  Hygicult tests help monitor for general bacteria, along with yeasts and fungi.  Neogen develops and markets products to improve food quality.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
